[center][size=5][b]Update Notes Skip[/b][/size]
Skips the No Man's Sky update notes page on startup.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
After a game update, No Man's Sky opens the update notes page automatically before the Main Menu. This mod skips that auto-open, so you go straight to the Main Menu. The notes page stays available through its normal menu button. Pair with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/nomanssky/mods/4706]Intro Skip[/url] and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/nomanssky/mods/4707]Mod Warning Skip[/url] for an uninterrupted startup.

[b]Requires:[/b] the [b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/nomanssky/mods/4700]Nozavolochen Framework[/url][/b] (provides the shared host DLL - spec-driven, no closed-source loaders).

[b]Install[/b]
Install like any other mod into [b]GAMEDATA/MODS[/b] so you end up with [b]GAMEDATA/MODS/Update Notes Skip/mod.toml[/b]. The Nozavolochen framework provides the host DLL. After launch [i]Binaries/nozavolochen.log[/i] shows what was applied or any errors.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Built for Forsaken[/*]
[*]Runtime memory patches applied by the host DLL at boot. No game files are modified, so there is nothing to merge and nothing to conflict with[/*]
[*]Patterns are checked before patching - a game update that shifts them is reported in the log instead of misbehaving[/*]
[/list]

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/nms-update-notes-skip]https://github.com/SavageCore/nms-update-notes-skip[/url]